{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeelevationsemantictokensprovider\/emphasized"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"emphasized"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ElevationCompositeSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic018ElevationCompositeB5Tokena","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/ElevationCompositeSemanticToken"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"emphasized","extendedModule":"OUDSThemesOrange","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"emphasized","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic018ElevationCompositeB5Tokena","text":"ElevationCompositeSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B36ThemeElevationSemanticTokensProviderC10emphasized010OUDSTokensE008MultipleD17CompositeRawTokenCvp","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ElevationCompositeSemanticTokens.emphasized"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider\/emphasized"},"references":{"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/MultipleElevationCompositeRawToken":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleElevationCompositeRawToken","url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multipleelevationcompositerawtoken","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleElevationCompositeRawToken"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleElevationCompositeRawToken"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Semantic tokens which will wrap a combination of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ElevationCompositeRawToken"},{"type":"text","text":" depending to color scheme (i.e. light mode or dark mode)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Figma"}]},{"type":"text","text":" inside one object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an elevation token exists with its value depending to the color scheme, it must be packed in such ``MultipleElevationCompositeRawToken`"}],"title":"MultipleElevationCompositeRawToken","role":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider/emphasized":{"title":"emphasized","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"emphasized","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ElevationCompositeSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic018ElevationCompositeB5Tokena"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeelevationsemantictokensprovider\/emphasized","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider\/emphasized"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"image","alt":null},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/ElevationCompositeSemanticToken":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/ElevationCompositeSemanticToken","url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/elevationcompositesemantictoken","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ElevationCompositeSemanticToken"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ElevationCompositeSemanticToken"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Basically an elevationcomposite  semantic token, used mainly for box shadow, is a pair of elevation composite raw tokens used depending to the color scheme."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleElevationCompositeRawToken"},{"type":"text","text":" contains "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ElevationCompositeRawToken"},{"type":"text","text":" objects for light and dark modes, which contains "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ElevationRawToken"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ColorRawToken"},{"type":"text","text":" values."}],"title":"ElevationCompositeSemanticToken","role":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeElevationSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"elevation semantic tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"multiple","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"composite","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" or not, and expose them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllElevationSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeelevationsemantictokensprovider"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Theme Orange","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","title":"Theme Orange"}}}